          "message": {
            "text": "Default shaped fallback must own dotted-circle insertion for uncovered broken clusters. Chromium passes the source cluster through HarfBuzz once; preprocessing U+25CC first made the later HarfBuzz pass insert a second circle. The legacy per-codepoint path retains synthesis because it never shapes .notdef.",
