          "message": {
            "text": "The selected-face HarfBuzz shape is the logical oracle when Linux Canvas reports an empty dottedCircleMarks array. With the preferred script applied, the focused Linux Vedic fixture moved from 0.47% / 14 regions to 0.00% / 0 regions; Phonetic Extensions and Latin Extended Additional remained at their prior 0.08% and 0.05% native-raster floors, confirming the change is isolated to shaping.",
            "markdown": "The selected-face HarfBuzz shape is the logical oracle when Linux Canvas reports an empty dottedCircleMarks array. With the preferred script applied, the focused Linux Vedic fixture moved from 0.47% / 14 regions to 0.00% / 0 regions; Phonetic Extensions and Latin Extended Additional remained at their prior 0.08% and 0.05% native-raster floors, confirming the change is isolated to shaping."
          },
